::narrative: arc2_leviathan_engines
@title: Arc 2 - Leviathan Engines
::scene: reveal
@title: The Submerged Colossus
!sfx: deep_rumble, bubble_roar
!music: leviathan_theme
!vfx: silhouette_glow
 !action: Massive ribs of an engine-beast loom from silt.
 [[ ENGINEER LYRA ]]
 "Scale index reads... impossible. This spans three graticules!"
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Log the readings. Wonder later. Secure now."
::end: {{ reveal }}
::scene: ignition
@title: Ignition Protocol
!sfx: crank_turn, pressure_build
!music: pulse_rhythm
 !action: Pressure gauges jitter toward the red.
 [[ ENGINEER LYRA ]]
 "Primary valves seated. Beginning prime."
 "Counting down—five... four... three..."
::end: {{ ignition }}
::scene: ignition_alt_emergency
@variant_of: ignition
@title: Ignition Protocol (Emergency Override)
!sfx: alarm_chime, pressure_build
!music: pulse_rhythm
!vfx: red_strobes
 !action: Sirens cascade; steam pistons lock.
 [[ ENGINEER LYRA ]]
 "Override accepted— rerouting coolant!" 
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Dump heat to ballast lines before we weld into a tomb."
::end: {{ ignition_alt_emergency }}
::end: {{ arc2_leviathan_engines }}
